{"id":"n77441-1-7","stage":4,"title":"진지 · 膳","scene":"餐饮与生活","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n77441-1-7-1","ko":"아버님, 아침 준비가 다 되었어요. 진지 드세요.","zh":"爸爸，早饭准备好了，请用餐。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"아버님,","meaning":"父亲，爸爸","explanation":"아버님：父亲，爸爸","readings":[{"term":"아버님","audio":"/audio/64187c187ea07eb8ba99.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71340","senseId":"2","lemma":"아버님","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"아침","meaning":"早饭，早餐","explanation":"아침：早饭，早餐","readings":[{"term":"아침","audio":"/audio/2fdd736548d881c6da93.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27368","senseId":"2","lemma":"아침","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"준비가","meaning":"准备","explanation":"준비：准备；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"준비","audio":"/audio/9ce364fc9c6f2a1ce188.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"86434","senseId":"1","lemma":"준비","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"다","meaning":"全，都","explanation":"다：全，都","readings":[{"term":"다","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58175","senseId":"1","lemma":"다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"되었어요.","meaning":"形成，完成","explanation":"되다：形成，完成；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"되다","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89858","senseId":"12","lemma":"되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"진지","meaning":"膳，餐","explanation":"진지：膳，餐","readings":[{"term":"진지","audio":"/audio/2f45f28d88f61c627937.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"77441","senseId":"1","lemma":"진지","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"드세요.","meaning":"用餐、吃或喝（敬语）","explanation":"들다：用餐、吃或喝（敬语）；시：主语敬语，尊敬动作或状态的主体。；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"들다","audio":"/audio/7ff37822e89462ea5014.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57293","senseId":"3","lemma":"들다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"64187c187ea07eb8","term":"아버님","zh":"父亲，爸爸","audio":"/audio/64187c187ea07eb8ba