99b.mp3","entryId":"27656","definition":"用于回答，表示“会那样做，是那样的，知道了”等肯定的含义。","pronunciation":["그래"]},{"id":"c2f53c24d7797085","term":"곧","zh":"马上，就","audio":"/audio/c2f53c24d77970856333.mp3","entryId":"26802","definition":"不拖延，紧接着。","pronunciation":["곧"]},{"id":"961ee88770fe6ab5","term":"나가다","zh":"出，出去","audio":"/audio/961ee88770fe6ab5a409.mp3","entryId":"71456","definition":"从某个地区或空间里移动到外部。","pronunciation":["나가다"]}],"audio":"/audio/2a3b9632e1db5c3116a9.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.4,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=77441","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":124,"sequenceScore":2.2267,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["爸爸，早饭准备好了，请用餐。","好，我这就出来。","这整栋楼都是禁止吸烟的吗？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["爸爸，早饭准备好了，请用餐。","好，我这就出来。","这整栋楼都是禁止吸烟的吗？"],"answer":1}]}
